      en: ["SOTEXCO is located in the Kinsoundi district of Brazzaville.", "The factory processes cotton into fabrics and garments.", "It was built with the support of international partners in the 1970s.", "The plant includes spinning, weaving, and printing units.", "The company is a key employer in the capital's industrial sector.", "SOTEXCO produces, among other things, traditional wax-print fabrics."],
